@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy & Access Policy";
}

<h1>Privacy & Access Policy</h1>

<p>
    This application is intended for authorized internal use only. Access to employee, department,
    project, and salary information is restricted to authenticated users.
</p>

<h4>Data Handling</h4>
<p>
    Employee records, salary information, department assignments, and project participation data are
    stored for operational and administrative purposes only.
</p>

<h4>Access Control</h4>
<p>
    Access to create, update, deactivate, or manage records is controlled through authentication and
    role-based authorization. Some features may be available only to Managers or Administrators.
</p>

<h4>Audit and Change Tracking</h4>
<p>
    Certain business operations, such as salary updates, are tracked to preserve historical records
    and support internal accountability.
</p>

<h4>Acceptable Use</h4>
<p>
    Users of this system are expected to use it responsibly, protect account credentials, and access
    only the data necessary for their assigned role and responsibilities.
</p>